OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fdry evening with clear spells in the
OL,7,Fwest. Cloud builds quickly through the
OL,8,Fnight with patchy rain and mist
OL,9,Fdeveloping by dawn. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average. Winds mostly light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with patchy light rain
OL,13,Fduring the day. Clearer spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping into the evening, but
OL,15,Finfilling again with rain arriving
OL,16,Finto Wednesday. Temperatures above
OL,17,Faverage throughout. Strengthening
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
